            "reviewBody": "good, but VERY pepperminty... think I might try 1/2 oz of peppermint schnapps next time.\nUPDATE: I did 1/2 oz schnapps and it was MUCH better!"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Michele Kusiak"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was really yummy ! We used it as an end of the night dessert drink. I followed what another reviewer said and only used a splash of peppermint schnapps. I added a splash of Baileys, dipped the rim in crushed candy canes and added crushed candy cane to the top ! Festive and delicious !",
            "datePublished": "2019-12-17T00:27:03.780Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "4"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "fudgie48"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Recipe as written was too minty for us. After much experimentation(tough job but someone has to do it!) our favorite version now consists of 1 oz cream, 1 oz chocolate flavored vodka and 2 oz cream de cacao.",
            "datePublished": "2014-01-21T10:48:29.037Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "4"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Jean Guarino"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is very minty, next time I'll just add a drop or two of schnapps. This drink is also excellent with Godiva chocolate liquor. I recommend a two drink limit with this tasty cocktail! It is so delicious and goes down very smoothly. I think it may be the large amount of sugar in the drink because the headache the next morning is quite awful!",
            "datePublished": "2011-01-18T12:00:38.620Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "4"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Oliver Vickery"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Made it and took advice from reviews and reduced by half the Peppermint Schnapps. Drink was minty as expected..proably could reduce Peppermint Schapps a bit more. But it all depends on you preference. Will make again.",
            "datePublished": "2018-12-02T23:08:06.127Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "TaraB"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Yum! I cut the schnapps in half right out of the gate because there's always too much for me. I may inch it up just a little. I used chocolate vodka instead of plain (I store many flavors of vodka in my freezer) which was a great success. Tried adding white chocolate liqueur because lots of peppermint martini recipes use it, but I thought it was too sweet. It's better this way!",
            "datePublished": "2014-11-29T13:23:12.273Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "lv2cook4"
            },
            "reviewBody": "My son made this drink for us and it came out great! He also added a bit of red food coloring for fun! Will make again. Very mild peppermint taste.",
            "datePublished": "2019-12-01T01:04:51.000Z"
