            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "kaleighrat"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This sounded fantastic. I drove to five stores to find the white creme de cacao just so I could make it. I was so excited when I got home I did a test run before my Christmas Eve party and it's a good thing I did. I did not care for it at all. I thought it just might be me, but my husband thought so too. I double checked the recipe and did a second test run with less peppermint schnapps as some reviewers suggested and it was a little better, but not much. If you have the stuff around, give it a try because all of the other reviews were good, you might like it, but I wouldn't go out of your way like I did.",
            "datePublished": "2011-12-26T16:58:23.217Z"
          },
          {
